  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>박혜진(경기 이의중) 선생님께서 공유해주신 자료입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>첫시간&#160;OT때&#160;보여주거나&#160;참고하실&#160;수&#160;있는&#160;유튜브영상&#160;하나&#160;공유합니다. <br>과학을&#160;왜&#160;배워야&#160;하는가에&#160;대한&#160;강연&#160;영상입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/rGUqU_0GC20?si=WCI3j9FHotq_Jr4o\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/rGUqU_0GC20?si=WCI3j9FHotq_Jr4o</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rGUqU_0GC20\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bdHpln/hyVufm7EIK/a8H2SID16cT7GXDkgxesX0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rGUqU_0GC20\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
